#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_House3/scripts.inc:28
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_House3_Text_YouWantSuperRod"
msgid ""
"Hey there, TRAINER!\n"
"A SUPER ROD really is super!\p"
"Say all you want, but this baby can\n"
"catch POKéMON off the seafloor!\p"
"What do you think?\n"
"You want it, don't you?$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，训练家！\n"
"厉害钓竿真的很厉害哦！\p"
"不管你怎么说，这家伙\n"
"可以钓到海底的宝可梦！\p"
"怎么样？\n"
"你很想要吧？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_House3/scripts.inc:36
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_House3_Text_SuperRodIsSuper"
msgid ""
"You bet, you bet!\n"
"After all, a SUPER ROD is really super!$"
msgstr ""
"就是嘛，就是嘛！\n"
"毕竟厉害钓竿真的很厉害！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_House3/scripts.inc:40
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_House3_Text_TryDroppingRodInWater"
msgid ""
"If there's any water, try dropping in\n"
"your ROD and see what bites!$"
msgstr ""
"只要有水，就试着把钓竿\n"
"放进水里，看看会钓到什么吧！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_House3/scripts.inc:44
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_House3_Text_DontYouLikeToFish"
msgid ""
"Hunh?\n"
"Don't you like to fish?$"
msgstr ""
"嗯？\n"
"你不喜欢钓鱼吗？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_House3/scripts.inc:48
msgctxt "MossdeepCity_House3_Text_GoAfterSeafloorPokemon"
msgid ""
"Go after the seafloor POKéMON with\n"
"your SUPER ROD.$"
msgstr ""
"用你的厉害钓竿\n"
"去钓海底的宝可梦吧。$"
